{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Western Death</i>, you navigate through rooms, slaying creatures, earning experience, and collecting new weapons. With each level-up, you can choose from various cards that grant unique perks and bonuses, enhancing your abilities and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Western Death</i>, you play as Jack Wotson, a fearless bounty hunter on a mission to track down the notorious serial killer John Willams, a man with the power to wield magic. Your goal is to stop Willams before his dark sorcery brings ruin to the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634880?t=1743909934","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634880/44637b7dd332607ccf3c092a8ceb1f05aa326099/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743909934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634880/9934c5015e9dae87c7e0d401dcd7efaa7aa89bfa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743909934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634880/9934c5015e9dae87c7e0d401dcd7efaa7aa89bfa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743909934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Western Death</i>, you navigate through rooms, slaying creatures, earning experience, and collecting new weapons. With each level-up, you can choose from various cards that grant unique perks and bonuses, enhancing your abilities and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Western Death</i>, you play as Jack Wotson, a fearless bounty hunter on a mission to track down the notorious serial killer John Willams, a man with the power to wield magic. Your goal is to stop Willams before his dark sorcery brings ruin to the world.</p>","developers":["Myzieks"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634880/09adb45dfed5a45d860d64da0ef8e924bb1d2605/header.jpg?t=1743909934","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Western Death","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-7100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 710<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or AMD Ryzen 3 3200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Myzieks"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"pegi":{"rating":"11"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Schimpfw\u00f6rte\nFantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634880/a3aed574305232b1f960fae5f29f5c6312e3cd47/ss_a3aed574305232b1f960fae5f29f5c6312e3cd47.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743909934","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634880/a3aed574305232b1f960fa